Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Cold boot: open the demo letter when the shell starts, so the saved state shows Quill with the demo open.
; Not yet applied by the recipe: rl's `settings.reg_files` names only its own files (see build-with-rl.sh and docs/decisions.md SITE-10).
;
